OL,3,GNEWSAFire station opens after #2.7m
OL,4,Arebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #2.7m fire station will help
OL,7,Fcrews respond to growing challenges
OL,8,Fsuch as wildfires and flooding,
OL,9,Faccording to a local MP.
OL,11,FThe new Howden Fire Station opened on
OL,12,FFriday and features a new appliance
OL,13,Fbay, improved changing and welfare
OL,14,Ffacilities, and a community meeting
OL,15,Fspace.
OL,17,FDavid Davis, MP for Goole and
OL,18,FPocklington, said the investment would
OL,19,Fstrengthen the fire service's ability
OL,20,Fto respond to incidents in the area.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
