OL,3,GNEWSAFire station opens after #2.7m
OL,4,Arebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Modern facilities like the
OL,7,Fnew station are essential if the fire
OL,8,Fand rescue service is to operate
OL,9,Feffectively and tackle any local
OL,10,Femergencies like the wood fire outside
OL,11,FPollington earlier this week."
